WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:05.140
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "BELIEVER"]
You made me a--

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.775
DAN REYNOLDS: I feel
like for many years--

00:00:06.775 --> 00:00:08.610
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "BELIEVER"]
--believer.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.260
--it was, I don't
really know who we are.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.760
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "BELIEVER"]
You made me a--

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.960
But this tour is the
first time that I knew

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.685
we are, Imagine Dragons.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.850
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.458
Well, here we are.

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.302
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:29.302 --> 00:00:32.630
DAN REYNOLDS: Our goal was
to be a self-sustained indie

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.090
band that could make
enough money to pay

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.290
rent and have food.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.210
No idea that it
would be this big.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.950
That's one in a billion.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.080
DANIEL WAYNE SERMON: We're
all past our wildest dreams.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.060
There's no words
for a night like this.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.010
We will give you
everything, because you

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.480
have given us everything.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.392
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "BELIEVER"]
You made me a, you

00:00:50.392 --> 00:00:53.073
made me a believer, believer.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.740
DANIEL WAYNE SERMON: If we
were playing for five people,

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.080
Dan was still larger
than life on stage.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.598
He's always been that guy.

00:01:02.598 --> 00:01:03.865
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "BELIEVER"]
Come on.

00:01:03.865 --> 00:01:05.868
You made me a, you made me a--

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:08.620
CROWD: --believer.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.650
Still feels like we're 
the hungry band

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.630
playing five nights a week.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:15.685
DAN REYNOLDS: Every day
that we have is a gift.

00:01:15.685 --> 00:01:18.800
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.160
May we spend less
time being divided,

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:25.670
may we spend more time
loving, more time forgiving.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.320
I get a look at people's faces.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:30.950
I get to see them feel
happy, cry, and sing the song

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:32.730
at the top their lungs.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.230
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "MY LIFE"]
These years pass

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:36.930
by, and we're growing older.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.110
And I think of you,
always made it through.

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:43.200
I have lost too many
people who think

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.120
that their life doesn't matter.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.441
Your life always matters.

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:48.774
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "MY LIFE"]
These years

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:51.120
pass by, and I'm growing older.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.240
Imagine Dragons just really
wants to make people feel safe

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.219
and loved.

00:01:55.219 --> 00:01:57.215
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "MY LIFE"]
So you've passed away.

00:01:57.215 --> 00:01:58.712
There's no words to sing.

00:01:58.712 --> 00:02:00.209
No second trust.

00:02:00.209 --> 00:02:01.706
Is this love?

00:02:03.613 --> 00:02:04.980
DANIEL WAYNE SERMON:
It's a bigger stage,

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:08.420
but nothing's really changed.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:12.670
[IMAGINE DRAGONS, "MY LIFE"] Is
this really my life, my life?

